---
description: Prepare one writeAccessibleText evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: AccessibilityChannelPlan[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Formulate concise, natural accessible text appropriate to the channel and supplied style guidance. Describe observable actions rather than inferred motives, identify speakers or meaningful sounds where needed, and preserve narrative tone without adding unsupported interpretation. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
